        "Content": "12 Beechdale Place, Ballycullen, Dublin 24, D24 RD40\r\nFor Sale by Private Treaty\r\n\r\nOverview\r\nAdvised Minimum Value (AMV): €425,000\r\n\r\nProperty Type: 3-Bed House with Converted Attic\r\n\r\nBedrooms: 3 Bedrooms + Converted Attic Space\r\n\r\nBathrooms: Downstairs Guest WC & Main Family Bathroom\r\n\r\nCondition: Turnkey / Beautifully Presented\r\n\r\nOrientation: Highly Desirable South-Facing Rear Garden\r\n\r\nKW Team Castles are delighted to present 12 Beechdale Place to the Dublin 24 market — AMV €425,000.\r\n\r\nNestled in a quiet and established residential cul-de-sac at the foot of the Dublin Mountains, 12 Beechdale Place comes to the market in turnkey condition. Beautifully presented and tastefully upgraded by its current owners, this ideal family home offers an expansive, light-filled layout further enhanced by a full attic conversion and a highly prized south-facing rear garden.\r\n\r\nProperty Description\r\nGround Floor\r\nStepping into the home, a warm and welcoming entrance hall features durable tiled flooring and a convenient guest WC under the stairs.\r\n\r\nTo the front, the main living room boasts rich wooden flooring centered around a stylish feature fireplace, creating a cozy yet elegant space to relax. To the rear, the house opens into an expansive open-plan kitchen and dining area. Laid with tiled flooring throughout, the kitchen is designed for modern living and direct access out to the garden.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor & Bedrooms\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation offers three well-proportioned bedrooms:\r\n\r\nMain Double Bedroom: Spacious double room equipped with custom built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nSecond Double Bedroom: Bright, generous double room.\r\n\r\nSingle Bedroom: Versatile room, ideal as a child’s bedroom or dedicated workspace.\r\n\r\nMain Family Bathroom: Modern family suite serving the upper floor.\r\n\r\nAttic Conversion\r\nA full staircase leads to the converted attic space, adding invaluable multi-purpose floor area. Featuring built-in wardrobes alongside clever eaves storage, this versatile room serves perfectly as a home office, playroom, or secondary lounge.\r\n\r\nGrounds & Outdoor Space\r\nRear Garden: A standout feature of the property is the beautifully maintained, sunny south-facing rear garden. Benefiting from day-long sunlight, it provides the perfect backdrop for outdoor dining, gardening, and summer entertaining.\r\n\r\nFront: Quiet cul-de-sac setting with ample communal and off-street parking.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\nAMV: €425,000\r\n\r\nPresented by: KW Team Castles\r\n\r\nTurnkey Condition: Beautifully maintained and updated throughout\r\n\r\nSunny South-Facing Rear Garden: Maximum natural light all day long\r\n\r\nConverted Attic Space: Fitted with built-in wardrobes and additional eaves storage\r\n\r\nOpen-Plan Kitchen & Dining Room\r\n\r\nLiving Room: Featuring wooden floors and a focal feature fireplace\r\n\r\nMain Double Bedroom: Fitted with built-in wardrobes\r\n\r\nTiled Entrance Hall & Guest Downstairs WC\r\n\r\nEircode: D24 RD40\r\n\r\nLocation & Amenities\r\nBeechdale Place is an enviable address in Ballycullen, balancing tranquil suburban living with immediate access to essential services:\r\n\r\nTransport: Excellent connection to the M50 motorway (Junction 12) and direct Dublin Bus routes (15, 15B, 49, 65B) getting you straight into the city centre.\r\n\r\nShopping & Leisure: Minutes from Woodstown Shopping Centre, Knocklyon Shopping Centre (SuperValu), Rathfarnham Shopping Centre, and Lidl/Aldi corridors.\r\n\r\nRecreation: On the doorstep of the Dublin Mountains, Marlay Park, St. Enda’s Park, and local sports clubs (Ballyboden St. Endas).\r\n\r\nSchools: Close proximity to highly regarded local schools including St. Colmcille’s primary and secondary schools, Firhouse Educate Together, and Gaelscoil Chnoc Liamhna.\r\n\r\nViewing Details\r\nStrictly by private appointment with KW Team Castles. Early viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nBER Number: 112646765"
      },
